From: PonWrt developers <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7915: propagate initial DMA start errors

Return the DMA enable result during initial queue setup. WED buffer
manager failures must reach the caller instead of continuing firmware
initialization with stopped DMA and interrupts.

---
--- a/mt7915/dma.c
+++ b/mt7915/dma.c
@@ -635,9 +635,7 @@
 			  mt7915_poll_tx);
 	napi_enable(&dev->mt76.tx_napi);
 
-	mt7915_dma_enable(dev, false);
-
-	return 0;
+	return mt7915_dma_enable(dev, false);
 }
 
 int mt7915_dma_reset(struct mt7915_dev *dev, bool force)
